{"sourceUrl":"https://yxy.njucm.edu.cn/2025/0724/c2989a158973/pagem.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:30.546816+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://yxy.njucm.edu.cn/2025/0724/c2989a158973/pagem.htm","html":"<div><p></p><h1><br/></h1><p><span><span>为了促进大学生之间的交流，吸引优秀学子了解南京</span><span><span>中医药</span></span><span>大学</span><span><span>药</span></span><span>学院，我们</span><span><span>拟</span></span><span>举办</span><span><span>南京中医药大学</span></span><span>药学院</span></span><span>2025</span><span><span>年优秀大学生</span><span><span>暑期</span></span><span>开放日，</span><span><span>欢迎</span></span><span>全国高校中药学、药学、中医学、中西医结合学、基础医学、生物学基础学科及交叉学科相关专业的在校优秀大三（四年制）及大四（五年制）学生报名参加。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>一、</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>申请资格</strong></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>全国高校中药学、药学、中医学、中西医结合学、基础医学、生物学基础学科及交叉学科相关专业的</span><span>三年级</span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四年制）</span></span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span><span>四年级（五年制）</span></span><span>本科生</span></span><span>(</span><span><strong>拟于</strong></span><span><strong>2026</strong></span><span><strong>年毕业</strong></span><span>)</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>热爱中医药学，有较强创新意识、创新潜力和专业能力。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>专业课学习成绩及英语水平优良，</span><span><span>本</span></span><span>科前</span><span><span>六</span></span><span>个学期（四年制）</span></span><span>/</span><span><span>前</span><span><span>八</span></span><span>个学期（五年制）总评成绩在年级前</span></span><span>30%</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span><strong><br/></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>二、</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>活动安排</strong></span></span></p><p><span>报名时间：即日起至</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>31</span><span>日</span></p><p><span>活动时间：</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>17 -22</span><span>日</span></p><p><span><span>线下活动地点：</span><span>南京中医药大学仙林校区</span></span></p><p><span>招生人数：</span><span>50</span><span>人左右</span></p><p><span><span><span>活动安排</span></span><span>：本期开放日拟聘请国内中医药类领域的顶尖专家授课，组织中医药传统文化体验、江苏省中医药博物馆参访</span><span><span>、</span></span><span>导师</span><span><span>见面</span></span><span>交流</span><span><span>会</span></span><span>、学生个人能力展示等活动。具体安排待后续通知，全体同学需按要求全程参加开放日活动。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>三、</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>申请流程</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>1.</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>学员报名及材料提交</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span>报名截止时间为</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>202</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>5</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>7</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>31</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span><span><span>。通过点击链接或扫描下方二维码报名。</span></span></span></p><p><span>   </span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yxy.njucm.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/a2/9e/55ad545a4b2f921bde43d7719d67/1909e76c-f2fd-4d6c-a5b6-9ff6ba459c6c.jpg\"/></p><p><span><span>链接：</span></span><span><span>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/YWNtC1c.aspx#  </span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span>申请材料提交</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>申请者</span></span><span><span><span>须</span></span></span><span><span>提交以下材料，并按以下顺序整理一份</span></span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span><span>文档，文件命名为</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>开放日</span></span></span><span><span>报名材料（姓名）</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>，发送至：</span></span></span><span><span><span>cxzhaolin@126.com</span></span></span><span><span><span>，邮件标题为“</span></span><span><span><span>开放日</span></span></span><span><span>报名材料</span></span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>院校</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>姓名”。申请材料提交截止时间为</span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>202</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>5</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>7</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>31</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>(1) 身份证复印件（正反面出现在一张</span></span><span><span>A4</span></span><span><span>纸上）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(2) 学生证扫描件（含基本信息）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(3) 全国大学英语等级证书扫描件（只提供最高等级的证书）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(4)<strong> 本科成绩单</strong></span></span><span><span>，本科前</span></span><span><span><span>六</span></span></span><span><span>个学期（四年制）</span></span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span><span>前</span></span><span><span><span>八</span></span></span><span><span>个学期（五年制）的成绩单（需有所在学校教务处或院系公章，机打成绩单已有公章的不必另外加盖）</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(5) <strong>成绩排名证明</strong></span></span><span><span>，本科学校用于测算推免资格的排名证明 </span></span></span><span><span>(</span></span><span><span>由所在院系或教务处盖章</span></span><span><span>)</span></span><span><span><span>，如不能提供，请所在院系或教务处给出不能提供成绩排名的证明</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>(6) 其他证明材料，如发表论文、奖状、各类证书等；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(7) 对中医药等领域感兴趣的研究方向与内容（</span></span><span><span>500</span></span><span><span>字以内）。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><strong>2.</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>遴选及名单公布</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>本次拟录取学员</span></span><span><span>50</span></span><span><span>名，入选学员名单于</span></span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span>月初在南京中医药大学</span></span><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span><span><span>院网站（</span></span></span><span><span>http://yxy.njucm.edu.cn</span></span><span><span><span>）及</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span>南中医</span></span><span><span><span>药院</span></span></span><span><span>研究生</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>微信公众号公布。</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>四、相关待遇与要求</strong></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>本次</span><span><span>开放日</span></span><span>不收取任何费用；</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>免费提供校内住宿及餐饮</span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>南京中医药大学校内学生不提供住宿</span></span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>提供在学期间人身意外保险</span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span>入选学员报到当天须携带本人身份证及学生证原件。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>五、</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>其他</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span>请报名者按照要求填写各项报名信息，相关成果需附上相应的证明材料。所有申报材料和信息均属实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，取消申请者参加资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>南京中医药大学药学院研究生培养办公室联系方式：赵老师，电话：</span></span><span>025-85811152</span><span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></span><span><span>cxzhaolin@126.com</span></span><span><span><span>。更多相关内容请留意南京中医药大学药学院网站</span></span><span>（</span></span><span>http://yxy.njucm.edu.cn</span><span><span>）及</span><span><span>“</span></span><span>南中医</span><span><span>药院</span></span><span>研究生</span><span><span>”</span></span><span>微信公众号</span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"fb2f261c43df14948ebdc9eaad119ca5ee4bf46178daec55c617cdc83c541a70","textLength":1337,"sourceSha256":"102dc91667b915deaa074cb925338a6e5a68dc90fe299d2b486b9d69d94f8b5e","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-dda2842ce76aa41351c3","title":"2025年南京中医药大学药学院2025年优秀大学生暑期开放日通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:30.546816+00:00"}
